{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41131","headline":"赵宗道归辇下 · 胡宿","name":"赵宗道归辇下","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"沿牒相逢楚水湄，竹林文酒此攀嵇。\n半毡未暖还伤别，一臂初交又解携。\n江浦呕哑风送樐，河桥勃窣柳垂堤。\n明年四月秦关到，洗眼扬州看马[蹄]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"胡宿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_41131.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_41131","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry、古籍注评：《唐诗鼓吹》（中文维基文库，CC BY-SA 4.0，https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/唐詩鼔吹_(四庫全書本)）"}